# replace linux execve (syscall 59) on windows: rdi = the image
# path, rsi = a null-ended argv. build a command line, spawn with
# CreateProcessA, wait, and ExitProcess with the child's code so
# this = exec, not fork. a failed spawn returns 0 and the caller
# prints the error. IAT 17 CreateProcessA, 18 GetExitCodeProcess,
# 15 WaitForSingleObject, 4 CloseHandle, 6 ExitProcess.
